# Keep the improvements list current

When you finish an item from `docs/NEXT_IMPROVEMENTS.md`, update that file in the same change. Do this without waiting to be asked.

- Add a short done note near the top.
- Change the item heading to end with `— done`, and replace the spec with what shipped.
- Remove that item from **Do these first**. If the list is empty, point it at the next open item.
- Leave unrelated open items as they are.
